<title>JAPAN: Morgan Stanley adds NTT to MSCI index.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley adds NTT to MSCI index.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Capital International (MSCI) said on Wednesday it has added Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp to its Japan index, at a market capitalisation of 0.80 percent, effective after the market closing on May 30.</p>
</text>
